    "chunk_text": "illon \u00fea weorc, \u00fe\u00e6t hi ne hliston leasum wordum. Witodlice \u00fea weorcgerefan & \u00fea \u00feenas eodon ut & cw\u00e6don to \u00feam folce: Pharao byt \u00fe\u00e6t man eow ne & \u00fe\u00e6t folc w\u00e6s todrifen ofer eall Egypta land ceaf to gaderienne. Wytodlice \u00fea weorcgerefan stodon myd heom, & cw\u00e6don: Gefylla\u00fe eowwer weorc d\u00e6ghwamlice, & Faraones \u00feenas swungon \u00fea \u00fee bewiston Israhela folces weorc, & \u00feus cw\u00e6don: Hwi ne gefylle ge \u00dea comon Israhela folces prafastas & clypodon to Pharaone, & \u00f0us cw\u00e6don: Hwi destu \u00feus wi\u00fe \u00f0ine Vs man ne sylle\u00f0 nan ceaf, & byt us \u00fe\u00e6t ilce tygelgeweorc; nu we \u00feine \u00f0eowas synd beswungene & \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe he: Ge synd \u00e6mtige & idele, & for \u00feam ge bidda\u00fe, L\u00e6ta\u00fe us faran & offrian urum Gode. Ga\u00fe witodlice & wyrcea\u00f0: ne syl\u00f0 eow man nan ceaf, & ge sceolon agyfan \u00fe\u00e6t ilce tigelget\u00e6l \u00fee ge & Israhela folces prafastas gesawon \u00fe\u00e6t hy w\u00e6ron geswencte, for \u00feam \u00f0e him w\u00e6s ges\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t hym \u00dea urnon \u00fea Israheliscan ongean Moyses & Aaron, \u00fea hig ut eodon fram Faraone. & cw\u00e6don to him: Geseoh Drihten & deme hw\u00e6t gyt us gel\u00e6red habba\u00f0; ge habba\u00f0 us gedon la\u00fee \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses to Drihtne: Hwi swinc\u00f0 \u00feis folc; Hwi sentst \u00f0u me to Pharaone",
